{"type":"FeatureCollection","municipality_code":"13362","pref":"東京都","city":"利島村","display_comment":"利島村には、地域の歴史や暮らしを伝える案内板や石碑があり、それらを手がかりに街歩きを楽しめます。 周辺には史跡や遺跡にまつわる場所が点在し、「大石山遺跡」、「ケッケイ山遺跡」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板を既存ピンと照らし合わせながら歩くと、見落としがちな地域の物語に出会いやすくなります。 「利島村郷土資料館」や「釣り」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。 さらに、「イセエビ」や「サザエ」といった名物や食文化に触れると、その土地らしい暮らしまで感じられるでしょう。","layer_counts":{"public_facilities":3,"scenic_nature_areas":3,"cultural_facilities":1,"tourism_resources":3},"total_features":10,"features":[{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"地域交流会館","category":"public","address":"利島村863","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"13362","municipality_pref":"東京都","municipality_name":"利島村","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.2819483,34.52913806]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"勤労福祉会館","category":"public","address":"利島村1351","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"13362","municipality_pref":"東京都","municipality_name":"利島村","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.280435,34.528622]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"public_facilities","name":"利島村役場","category":"public","address":"利島村248","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"13362","municipality_pref":"東京都","municipality_name":"利島村","municipality_code_method":"source_exact_coord"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.282584,34.529354]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"scenic_nature_areas","name":"自然公園特別地域","category":"nature","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"13362","municipality_pref":"東京都","municipality_name":"利島村","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_class":"自然公園特別地域","source_dataset_code":"A10"},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[139.27254309000003,34.530879090000006],[139.27326231,34.53048685],[139.27353036000002,34.530343040000005],[139.273636400